WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.070
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

3
01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 26= (This drama does not correspond)

5
01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
04:23.740 --> 04:29.199
(Life is but a journey, and I too am a traveler.)

8
04:29.199 --> 04:30.319
I know

9
04:32.279 --> 04:34.000
you have no feelings for me

10
04:37.120 --> 04:40.000
and were only going along with your parents' wishes.

11
04:41.800 --> 04:44.800
I thought that since we shared similar interests,

12
04:45.560 --> 04:47.360
if we treated each other sincerely,

13
04:48.040 --> 04:49.959
affection would surely grow with time.

14
04:53.079 --> 04:54.639
Now, I'm actually glad

15
04:56.720 --> 04:58.000
that this marriage

16
05:00.360 --> 05:02.160
was only something I wanted.

17
05:03.920 --> 05:04.800
Your heart

18
05:06.680 --> 05:08.160
should be free.

19
05:12.740 --> 05:14.900
♪My thoughts are like a red umbrella♪

20
05:15.620 --> 05:17.540
♪Drifting through the rain♪

21
05:17.940 --> 05:22.820
♪Held tightly in my hand, shielding me from hidden currents♪

22
05:23.220 --> 05:28.100
♪Yet fate stains my sleeves with blood♪

23
05:28.260 --> 05:32.700
♪Raindrops fall, one by one, into my dreams♪

24
05:35.160 --> 05:36.120
Tomorrow,

25
05:39.360 --> 05:41.040
I'll be returning to the academy.

26
05:42.824 --> 05:45.080
Once I've finished the provincial examination this fall,

27
05:47.560 --> 05:48.560
I'll come back.

28
05:49.300 --> 05:54.660
♪With guilt in my heart, how could I ask to meet again?♪

29
05:56.660 --> 06:01.540
♪May I be like a firefly awakening in the dark♪

30
06:01.700 --> 06:06.860
♪Even if I only cast light on one cycle of bloom and decay♪

31
06:06.860 --> 06:12.060
♪If only I could move someone's heart♪

32
06:12.740 --> 06:17.500
♪I'd spend every dawn and dusk to see it through♪

33
06:17.500 --> 06:22.620
♪May I be like a firefly awakening in the dark♪

34
06:22.620 --> 06:28.260
♪Even if I only illuminate a single corner♪

35
06:28.620 --> 06:33.620
♪If I could bring light to someone's eyes♪

36
06:33.620 --> 06:35.304
(Heaven and earth are an endless journey, and the fleeting years)

37
06:35.310 --> 06:37.090
(but passing travelers. How could I alone remain still?)

38
06:37.100 --> 06:41.460
♪I'd spend this life and call it courage♪

39
06:43.000 --> 06:44.680
With a true friend anywhere in the world,

40
06:48.240 --> 06:50.040
any place can feel like home.

41
06:57.800 --> 06:59.360
This is where we part.

42
07:02.519 --> 07:03.240
Take care

43
07:04.519 --> 07:05.319
of yourself.

44
07:05.319 --> 07:09.340
♪May I be like a firefly awakening in the dark♪

45
07:09.340 --> 07:14.860
♪Even if I only illuminate a single corner♪

46
07:14.860 --> 07:19.700
♪If I could bring light to someone's eyes♪

47
07:19.700 --> 07:31.620
♪I'd spend this life and call it courage♪

48
07:47.680 --> 07:49.256
(This amulet is for Jinqi, isn't it?)

49
07:49.288 --> 07:51.800
(Invite the Lin family over on the pretext of a tea gathering.)

50
07:51.800 --> 07:54.000
(Does the Lin family intend to break off the engagement?)

51
07:54.000 --> 07:55.279
(So you can meet with Jinqi.)

52
07:55.280 --> 07:56.600
(I fear the Lin family is eager)

53
07:56.879 --> 07:58.639
(Lin) (to have you marry into their family.)

54
07:59.784 --> 08:02.240
(Letter of Dissolution) (Their birth dates are incompatible.)

55
08:02.959 --> 08:04.959
(Forcing this union)

56
08:05.519 --> 08:07.040
(may only breed resentment)

57
08:07.624 --> 08:09.160
(and turn affection into bitterness.)

58
08:09.160 --> 08:10.720
The Lin family has gone too far!

59
08:17.319 --> 08:19.920
We hereby agree to dissolve the engagement

60
08:21.040 --> 08:23.079
and each seek a more suitable match.

61
08:26.519 --> 08:27.600
From this day forward,

62
08:29.240 --> 08:31.160
there shall be no further ties between us.

63
08:33.440 --> 08:35.000
May we never

64
08:37.080 --> 08:38.519
bear resentment toward each other.

65
08:53.100 --> 08:57.540
(One Month Later)

66
08:58.060 --> 09:02.340
(Legacy and Glory)

67
09:14.799 --> 09:16.320
Do you know what you did wrong?

68
09:18.600 --> 09:19.159
I do.

69
09:21.000 --> 09:22.440
What did you do wrong?

70
09:24.056 --> 09:26.328
I petitioned His Majesty for an imperial marriage decree.

71
09:27.759 --> 09:29.080
My third son-in-law is now

72
09:29.399 --> 09:31.200
Commander of the Rear Military Command,

73
09:31.256 --> 09:32.630
and through him, my third daughter

74
09:32.840 --> 09:34.679
has also received a First-Rank honorary title.

75
09:35.240 --> 09:36.399
You wretched fool!

76
09:36.424 --> 09:38.300
What should have been a tremendous achievement

77
09:38.360 --> 09:39.679
was squandered on marrying a maid.

78
09:39.740 --> 09:41.688
You've made us the laughingstock of Jinling City

79
09:42.200 --> 09:43.679
and utterly disgraced me.

80
09:43.680 --> 09:45.288
I don't even dare show my face outside!

81
09:45.600 --> 09:47.559
How can you face the grandfather who raised you?

82
09:47.656 --> 09:48.936
(Legacy and Glory) How can you

83
09:48.940 --> 09:50.472
face the ancestors of the Lin family?

84
09:52.120 --> 09:55.519
You knew your mother was arranging a marriage for you.

85
09:55.879 --> 09:59.840
Why didn't you tell your parents and elders how you felt?

86
10:01.840 --> 10:02.919
I love Young Lady Xu

87
10:03.639 --> 10:04.720
and want to marry her.

88
10:05.448 --> 10:07.360
I knew parents and elders would never agree,

89
10:08.200 --> 10:09.399
so I came up with this plan

90
10:09.848 --> 10:11.360
to bypass the elders of the family

91
10:11.496 --> 10:13.816
and petition His Majesty directly for an imperial decree.

92
10:17.120 --> 10:17.960
You unfilial son.

93
10:18.720 --> 10:20.399
Look at the unfilial son you've raised!

94
10:24.440 --> 10:25.704
For your own selfish desires,

95
10:25.752 --> 10:27.736
you arranged your marriage without telling us,

96
10:27.919 --> 10:29.720
disregarding the family's reputation

97
10:29.848 --> 10:31.750
and everything your parents have done for you.

98
10:32.080 --> 10:34.360
This is a grave act of filial impiety!

99
10:39.080 --> 10:40.559
If you're not severely punished today,

100
10:40.560 --> 10:42.220
our descendants will follow your example,

101
10:42.230 --> 10:45.048
and the natural order and moral bonds will surely be thrown into chaos.

102
10:45.960 --> 10:47.399
Bring out the family rod!

103
11:07.340 --> 11:09.940
♪The golden sunset♪

104
11:09.940 --> 11:13.500
♪Sketches my thoughts♪

105
11:14.980 --> 11:17.540
♪All things fall silent♪

106
11:17.540 --> 11:20.860
♪Fearing to disturb this moment♪

107
11:21.540 --> 11:24.620
♪My restless heart seeks a place to anchor♪

108
11:26.840 --> 11:27.600
Strike him!

109
11:29.340 --> 11:34.860
♪I wonder if the past has ever been heard♪

110
11:37.420 --> 11:40.900
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

111
11:40.900 --> 11:44.500
♪Lightly traced cause and effect♪

112
11:45.340 --> 11:51.060
♪Half a lifetime of longing returns to this moment♪

113
11:51.500 --> 11:55.100
♪Love and guilt intertwine♪

114
11:55.460 --> 11:58.980
♪If the image isn't real, what does it matter?♪

115
11:59.300 --> 12:04.860
♪I still remember your name♪

116
12:06.580 --> 12:09.140
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

117
12:09.140 --> 12:13.540
♪For withholding its light♪

118
12:14.380 --> 12:17.780
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

119
12:17.780 --> 12:21.300
♪Still live and thrive♪

120
12:21.820 --> 12:26.300
♪No longer let the world's wind and snow fall♪

121
12:26.300 --> 12:29.260
♪And leave the grass and trees covered in frost♪

122
12:29.260 --> 12:33.420
♪I only wish that where the lights grow dim♪

123
12:33.780 --> 12:37.140
♪You and I will walk there together♪

124
12:37.140 --> 12:40.820
♪I no longer search through old dreams♪

125
12:40.820 --> 12:43.660
♪Leaving them buried deep within the years♪

126
12:44.660 --> 12:48.220
♪I only long to journey through the night together♪

127
12:48.220 --> 12:51.420
♪Toward where my heart leads♪

128
12:52.140 --> 12:56.660
♪I no longer lament that fate is hard to foresee♪

129
12:56.660 --> 12:59.660
♪Accepting the unexpected as ordinary♪

130
12:59.660 --> 13:03.700
♪I only wish the road behind us would fade like mist♪

131
13:03.700 --> 13:09.460
♪And we would share the road home♪

132
13:13.320 --> 13:14.840
Third Young Lady is back!

133
13:51.919 --> 13:53.759
Grandfather. Grandmother.

134
13:54.200 --> 13:55.759
Father. Mother.

135
13:56.000 --> 13:57.519
Uncle. Aunt.

136
13:57.848 --> 13:59.768
May fortune and blessings be yours today.

137
14:24.520 --> 14:26.280
Third Young Lady doesn't come home often.

138
14:26.960 --> 14:28.159
Hurry and bring her some tea.

139
14:28.630 --> 14:30.056
Please come inside and have a seat.

140
14:30.480 --> 14:31.279
My fault.

141
14:31.559 --> 14:32.919
I heard Jinqi was back,

142
14:33.039 --> 14:34.600
and I rushed over

143
14:34.600 --> 14:35.919
without even sending word first.

144
14:43.759 --> 14:44.720
Let's go inside.

145
15:16.080 --> 15:17.120
Everyone else may leave.

146
15:30.180 --> 15:33.350
(Pride and Arrogance)

147
15:33.759 --> 15:34.799
That scared me to death.

148
15:36.720 --> 15:38.240
My legs are still weak.

149
15:39.096 --> 15:41.640
I was terrified Jinqi would be beaten so badly he'd be crippled.

150
15:41.879 --> 15:43.159
Thank goodness Xiuru arrived...

151
15:44.039 --> 15:44.840
Jinqi...

152
15:45.000 --> 15:46.360
Jinqiao, be careful.

153
15:49.399 --> 15:50.840
Even if Xiuru hadn't come,

154
15:51.279 --> 15:53.039
Jinqi wouldn't have ended up crippled.

155
15:53.600 --> 15:54.879
I already had a plan.

156
15:55.080 --> 15:56.360
I'd pretend my stomach hurt

157
15:56.360 --> 15:58.904
and roll around on the floor, wailing at the top of my lungs.

158
15:59.120 --> 16:00.279
Old Madam dotes on me.

159
16:00.279 --> 16:01.720
She'd surely panic

160
16:01.848 --> 16:03.256
and start crying and shouting.

161
16:04.960 --> 16:06.159
That's a good plan.

162
16:06.360 --> 16:07.399
It would definitely work.

163
16:08.200 --> 16:09.759
That little head of yours

164
16:10.039 --> 16:10.799
is pretty clever.

165
16:11.480 --> 16:12.279
Go sit over there.

166
16:14.519 --> 16:15.120
Jinlan,

167
16:15.240 --> 16:17.272
you were about to pretend to faint, weren't you?

168
16:17.639 --> 16:19.320
I saw you put your hand over your chest.

169
16:21.879 --> 16:23.639
I was frightened out of my wits, too.

170
16:23.919 --> 16:24.799
I should have realized

171
16:24.800 --> 16:27.176
Jinqi would have arranged for someone to come to his rescue.

172
16:27.399 --> 16:29.960
And the best person for that was naturally Xiuru.

173
16:32.159 --> 16:34.440
No wonder Xiuru arrived at just the right time.

174
16:34.440 --> 16:35.279
Right on cue.

175
16:38.480 --> 16:41.200
So Xiuru was the one Jinqi called in to save him?

176
16:41.519 --> 16:43.039
You're only figuring that out now?

177
16:43.120 --> 16:44.039
Third Young Lady.

178
16:45.272 --> 16:46.480
I hadn't come through the door

179
16:46.480 --> 16:48.280
when I heard Jinqiao making a fuss about me.

180
16:50.000 --> 16:51.559
Xiuru and Xiushu are here.

181
16:52.159 --> 16:53.720
He's praising you for saving Jinqi.

182
16:55.039 --> 16:55.840
Jinqi.

183
16:57.759 --> 16:58.759
How is Mother?

184
16:59.704 --> 17:02.760
Mother has always been proud and cared deeply about her reputation.

185
17:03.000 --> 17:05.359
She placed all her hopes on you.

186
17:05.720 --> 17:07.650
You arranged your marriage without telling her,

187
17:07.680 --> 17:09.079
so naturally, she's upset.

188
17:11.319 --> 17:13.720
But I've already tried to comfort her.

189
17:13.730 --> 17:15.730
This marriage was bestowed by His Majesty himself.

190
17:15.740 --> 17:17.320
There's no other honor like it here.

191
17:17.330 --> 17:19.190
If any gossip dares wag their tongue about it,

192
17:19.200 --> 17:20.920
they're questioning His Majesty's decree.

193
17:20.968 --> 17:22.270
They'll pay dearly for that.

194
17:23.528 --> 17:26.570
It's only been a few days, and I already have to see you in a whole new light.

195
17:26.720 --> 17:28.480
Xiuru, you really are a Marchioness now.

196
17:32.839 --> 17:34.200
Some of my drinking companions

197
17:34.200 --> 17:35.680
made fun of me over this before.

198
17:35.680 --> 17:37.640
I got so angry that I got into a fight with them.

199
17:37.759 --> 17:39.680
If I'd learned that line from Xiuru sooner,

200
17:39.680 --> 17:41.150
I wouldn't have needed to fight them.

201
17:41.160 --> 17:42.359
Look what they did to me.

202
17:44.360 --> 17:47.240
If you know they're just drinking companions, why keep seeing them?

203
17:48.119 --> 17:48.759
All right.

204
17:49.799 --> 17:51.119
Jinqi, does it hurt?

205
17:52.640 --> 17:53.240
No.

206
17:53.928 --> 17:55.780
Jinqi, take good care of yourself and recover.

207
17:55.799 --> 17:56.920
Don't worry about Mother.

208
17:57.160 --> 17:58.440
I'll study hard,

209
17:58.559 --> 18:00.680
tell Mother jokes and massage her legs every day,

210
18:00.720 --> 18:01.992
and keep her in good spirits.

211
18:02.359 --> 18:03.839
I also have a parrot

212
18:04.279 --> 18:05.880
that's especially good at talking.

213
18:06.350 --> 18:08.744
And lately, Mother has been making me study for the exams,

214
18:08.776 --> 18:10.310
so I haven't had time to play with it.

215
18:10.519 --> 18:12.000
I'll take it to Rongzhang House.

216
18:12.160 --> 18:14.279
I'm sure First Madam will be delighted.

217
18:15.240 --> 18:16.039
Xiushu.

218
18:16.200 --> 18:19.319
I'll make faces for Aunt Shunhua.

219
18:19.880 --> 18:21.960
Old Madam always laughs when I make faces.

220
18:22.839 --> 18:24.559
If she doesn't like this one,

221
18:26.480 --> 18:27.799
then I'll do this one instead.

222
18:27.799 --> 18:30.220
♪The wind blows past distant hills♪

223
18:31.220 --> 18:34.500
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

224
18:35.500 --> 18:39.460
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

225
18:40.140 --> 18:43.580
♪Peace of heart in three places♪

226
18:44.020 --> 18:47.580
♪The years are calluses in our palms♪

227
18:48.820 --> 18:52.100
♪And the worries etched between our brows♪

228
18:53.340 --> 18:57.580
♪Birds carry twigs into the distance♪

229
18:57.580 --> 19:00.700
♪While two pairs of eyes watch from below♪

230
19:00.720 --> 19:01.759
Let's go together.

231
19:02.079 --> 19:03.160
I think you did well, too.

232
19:03.960 --> 19:04.759
All right.

233
19:04.920 --> 19:06.310
Jinqi needs some peace and quiet.

234
19:07.200 --> 19:08.519
Why don't you all come to my place

235
19:08.880 --> 19:11.160
and let your second sister-in-law make you some fresh tea?

236
19:11.519 --> 19:12.839
I've been thinking about her, too.

237
19:13.200 --> 19:15.039
We haven't had a chance to talk in ages.

238
19:15.039 --> 19:16.119
I'd like to go see her.

239
19:17.079 --> 19:17.559
Jinqi,

240
19:17.759 --> 19:18.680
we're leaving.

241
19:18.839 --> 19:19.799
Get plenty of rest.

242
19:22.000 --> 19:23.200
Jinqi, get plenty of rest.

243
19:30.240 --> 19:31.960
Why are you still sitting here?

244
19:31.960 --> 19:32.920
Go on.

245
19:32.920 --> 19:34.119
Jinqi, I'll come see you later.

246
19:34.120 --> 19:35.240
Remember to apply your medicine.

247
19:35.240 --> 19:36.200
You'll recover more slowly if you don't.

248
19:36.200 --> 19:36.599
I know.

249
19:36.599 --> 19:38.480
All right, enough. Stop fussing.

250
20:05.880 --> 20:06.559
Young Master.

251
20:07.279 --> 20:08.559
Shall I put it here?

252
20:18.960 --> 20:20.039
Are Jiugao and Nanke

253
20:20.599 --> 20:21.519
still being punished?

254
20:23.544 --> 20:26.120
Yes. They're kneeling outside Old Master's room as punishment.

255
20:26.880 --> 20:27.640
They'll be fine.

256
20:28.400 --> 20:29.839
Uncle Geng will plead for them.

257
20:32.000 --> 20:33.599
I wasn't worried about him.

258
20:39.680 --> 20:40.359
By the way,

259
20:40.960 --> 20:42.400
find a capable servant

260
20:42.664 --> 20:44.790
to take the gifts I brought back from the capital

261
20:45.039 --> 20:46.160
to Lanxiang's family.

262
20:46.599 --> 20:47.559
Tell them

263
20:48.000 --> 20:49.480
they're for Uncle Xu and Aunt Xu.

264
20:50.119 --> 20:51.000
And based on

265
20:51.359 --> 20:52.799
what Lanxiang usually likes,

266
20:52.840 --> 20:54.400
prepare some things she uses every day

267
20:54.472 --> 20:55.680
and send them along as well.

268
20:56.440 --> 20:57.200
Yes.

269
20:58.920 --> 20:59.519
Yuchan.

270
21:01.240 --> 21:02.279
What do you

271
21:04.079 --> 21:05.039
make of all this?

272
21:09.400 --> 21:10.759
As maids,

273
21:11.359 --> 21:13.680
our fates are in our masters' hands.

274
21:14.056 --> 21:16.376
When First Madam was arranging a marriage for Young Master,

275
21:16.559 --> 21:18.079
I was very nervous.

276
21:18.599 --> 21:20.559
Now that I know it's settled on Young Lady Xu,

277
21:21.440 --> 21:24.200
after the initial shock, I actually feel relieved.

278
21:24.920 --> 21:27.720
Rather than serve a Young Madam whose character I know nothing about,

279
21:28.599 --> 21:30.839
I'd naturally prefer Young Lady Xu to become our madam.

280
21:34.640 --> 21:35.680
Don't worry, Young Master.

281
21:36.440 --> 21:39.119
Young Lady Xu saved my life,

282
21:39.359 --> 21:41.079
and she's the Young Madam you've chosen.

283
21:41.680 --> 21:42.440
From now on,

284
21:42.960 --> 21:44.599
I'll serve her faithfully.

285
21:49.016 --> 21:50.000
Go on with your work.

286
22:50.440 --> 22:51.240
Yuan...

287
22:51.440 --> 22:52.079
Commander Yuan!

288
22:52.440 --> 22:53.240
Commander Yuan!

289
22:53.680 --> 22:54.319
Commander Yuan!

290
22:56.160 --> 22:57.359
I lost my senses for a moment

291
22:57.400 --> 22:58.490
and made a terrible mistake.

292
22:58.640 --> 23:00.559
Please give me a chance to redeem myself.

293
23:01.736 --> 23:02.960
I want to expose Prince Han!

294
23:04.519 --> 23:05.480
To maintain his troops,

295
23:05.500 --> 23:07.100
he secretly colluded with the Wo people

296
23:07.110 --> 23:08.328
and made enormous profits.

297
23:10.472 --> 23:11.720
If you bring down Prince Han,

298
23:11.832 --> 23:13.720
that would be an extraordinary achievement.

299
23:14.680 --> 23:15.880
All I ask is to live.

300
23:16.039 --> 23:16.720
All the credit

301
23:17.720 --> 23:18.920
will be yours, Commander.

302
23:20.920 --> 23:22.000
Commander Yuan,

303
23:22.070 --> 23:23.256
you are a magnanimous man.

304
23:23.960 --> 23:26.119
I have nothing left but this worthless life.

305
23:26.960 --> 23:27.880
Please spare me.

306
23:28.559 --> 23:29.279
Please spare me.

307
23:29.559 --> 23:30.200
Spare me.

308
23:30.264 --> 23:31.240
Have mercy, Commander!

309
23:31.240 --> 23:32.780
- Have mercy! - Have mercy!

310
23:32.799 --> 23:33.799
Have mercy, My Lord!

311
23:34.200 --> 23:34.799
Have mercy!

312
23:34.920 --> 23:35.880
His Majesty has decreed.

313
23:36.680 --> 23:38.480
The traitor Zheng Baichuan and his sons,

314
23:38.839 --> 23:39.440
Zheng Qing

315
23:39.799 --> 23:40.519
and Zheng Yun,

316
23:41.048 --> 23:42.350
harbored treacherous intentions,

317
23:42.440 --> 23:43.480
defied all proper order,

318
23:43.880 --> 23:45.079
and disrupted the court.

319
23:46.079 --> 23:48.160
The law and discipline must be upheld.

320
23:48.799 --> 23:49.480
All male members

321
23:49.592 --> 23:50.880
are to be executed immediately.

322
23:51.176 --> 23:52.000
All female members

323
23:52.168 --> 23:54.264
are to be consigned to the Imperial Music Bureau.

324
24:01.880 --> 24:02.960
My Lord, I'm innocent!

325
24:03.096 --> 24:04.310
Commander, I'm innocent!

326
24:04.344 --> 24:05.440
I've been falsely accused!

327
24:05.720 --> 24:06.519
I'm innocent!

328
24:06.519 --> 24:07.880
Prince Han deceived me!

329
24:08.559 --> 24:09.480
I'm innocent!

330
24:09.799 --> 24:10.599
I'm innocent!

331
24:11.279 --> 24:12.319
I'm innocent!

332
24:12.319 --> 24:13.559
It was all my father's idea!

333
24:13.559 --> 24:14.960
Commander!

334
24:15.400 --> 24:16.240
I'm innocent!

335
24:16.720 --> 24:17.839
I've been falsely accused!

336
24:18.799 --> 24:19.559
Let go of me!

337
24:19.560 --> 24:20.559
Commander, I'm innocent!

338
24:20.559 --> 24:21.839
Commander!

339
24:23.680 --> 24:24.240
Commander!

340
24:39.544 --> 24:41.310
Once we reach the Imperial Music Bureau,

341
24:41.960 --> 24:43.359
with your beauty and talents,

342
24:43.519 --> 24:44.920
you're sure to win someone's favor

343
24:45.319 --> 24:47.599
and find a way for us both to survive.

344
24:49.519 --> 24:51.720
You're the daughter of a duke's family,

345
24:52.119 --> 24:53.559
pure and respectable.

346
24:54.119 --> 24:55.359
You're nothing like those lowly

347
24:55.359 --> 24:57.039
singers and dancers.

348
24:58.590 --> 25:00.152
When the time comes, many men

349
25:00.184 --> 25:01.680
will surely take an interest in you.

350
25:02.319 --> 25:04.000
You must seize your chance.

351
25:16.119 --> 25:17.359
Mother is right.

352
25:19.440 --> 25:21.559
I'm the daughter of a duke's family,

353
25:22.920 --> 25:24.400
pure and respectable.

354
25:43.599 --> 25:44.400
Everyone out!

355
25:45.039 --> 25:46.000
Move quickly!

356
26:07.720 --> 26:08.559
Put down the sword!

357
26:14.279 --> 26:15.119
Young Lady Zheng.

358
26:15.799 --> 26:16.880
Put down your weapon.

359
26:17.079 --> 26:18.400
Don't put up a pointless struggle.

360
26:22.720 --> 26:23.640
Do you want to die?

361
26:27.440 --> 26:29.200
I can give you a quick death, Mother.

362
26:30.759 --> 26:31.960
Have you lost your mind?

363
26:32.720 --> 26:33.240
No!

364
26:33.839 --> 26:34.440
No!

365
26:34.759 --> 26:35.599
No!

366
26:42.400 --> 26:43.920
If we dared commit treason,

367
26:45.839 --> 26:47.759
why should we fear death?

368
27:34.440 --> 27:35.119
Move!

369
27:39.119 --> 27:39.519
Move!

370
27:47.799 --> 27:48.319
Ding Peng.

371
27:49.464 --> 27:50.880
Follow the Zheng family's women

372
27:50.960 --> 27:52.160
to the Imperial Music Bureau.

373
27:52.759 --> 27:54.039
Tell them to look after them.

374
27:55.640 --> 27:56.000
Yes.

375
28:13.640 --> 28:15.480
(When my sister took her own life,)

376
28:16.119 --> 28:18.680
(she was about the same age as Zheng Manyi,)

377
28:19.079 --> 28:21.640
(a young lady in the prime of her life,)

378
28:22.079 --> 28:24.279
(and just like that, she was gone.)

379
28:35.480 --> 28:37.519
Justice always prevails.

380
28:39.400 --> 28:41.599
Retribution never fails.

381
28:44.200 --> 28:45.599
The Zheng family

382
28:45.880 --> 28:49.759
has actually met the same fate as mine.

383
28:59.119 --> 29:00.079
Back then,

384
29:01.680 --> 29:04.079
when the late Emperor attacked Jinling,

385
29:05.400 --> 29:10.880
my father and Zheng Baichuan defended Jinling together.

386
29:13.599 --> 29:16.160
Zheng Baichuan betrayed the deposed Emperor

387
29:17.400 --> 29:19.359
and surrendered the city.

388
29:22.039 --> 29:24.039
My father refused to surrender.

389
29:28.839 --> 29:30.319
The men in our family were killed,

390
29:32.039 --> 29:32.960
and the women

391
29:34.319 --> 29:36.119
were sent to the Imperial Music Bureau.

392
29:41.039 --> 29:42.240
Don't touch my daughter!

393
29:43.200 --> 29:44.160
Mother

394
29:45.519 --> 29:46.480
and my sister

395
29:48.359 --> 29:49.880
refused to suffer such humiliation

396
29:50.400 --> 29:51.790
and threw themselves into the river.

397
29:51.880 --> 29:53.240
The Shen family would rather break

398
29:54.000 --> 29:55.359
than bend.

399
29:55.599 --> 29:58.200
I have never regretted marrying into the Shen family.

400
29:58.680 --> 30:01.359
Let me see you off one last time.

401
30:02.559 --> 30:04.000
I was young then

402
30:05.640 --> 30:08.039
and somehow survived in confusion until now.

403
30:14.920 --> 30:16.720
It's been twenty-three years.

404
30:23.519 --> 30:25.000
I can no longer remember

405
30:27.759 --> 30:29.759
what Father, Mother,

406
30:29.920 --> 30:32.039
or my brothers looked like.

407
30:33.319 --> 30:34.960
I only vaguely remember

408
30:37.400 --> 30:39.039
that my sister was very gentle.

409
30:42.000 --> 30:43.440
At the Imperial Music Bureau,

410
30:44.440 --> 30:46.519
we rarely got to have meat porridge.

411
30:47.960 --> 30:48.839
My sister

412
30:49.920 --> 30:51.400
would always pick out the meat

413
30:52.400 --> 30:54.319
piece by piece

414
30:55.880 --> 30:57.680
and put it in my bowl.

415
31:09.799 --> 31:10.759
No more sadness.

416
31:12.680 --> 31:13.599
No more sadness.

417
31:17.359 --> 31:18.880
The late Emperor is dead.

418
31:20.440 --> 31:22.279
Zheng Baichuan is dead, too.

419
31:22.680 --> 31:23.799
That's a good thing.

420
31:24.519 --> 31:25.599
We should be happy.

421
31:25.839 --> 31:27.359
We should all be happy.

422
31:31.720 --> 31:32.920
In the play,

423
31:34.839 --> 31:38.160
the Mountain Deity upholds justice for Tanniang

424
31:38.680 --> 31:40.319
and punishes the corrupt official.

425
31:40.519 --> 31:43.720
But what about real people like us?

426
31:44.720 --> 31:47.039
My father and yours

427
31:47.359 --> 31:50.559
were both loyal to the sovereign and defended the city.

428
31:51.119 --> 31:53.559
What did they do wrong?

429
31:54.000 --> 31:55.480
And if they did nothing wrong,

430
31:57.000 --> 32:00.680
then who will uphold justice for us

431
32:01.559 --> 32:03.680
and punish the Emperor?

432
32:06.720 --> 32:07.680
Lu Zongbai.

433
32:08.200 --> 32:10.640
Everyone says you're learned.

434
32:11.119 --> 32:12.319
Tell me,

435
32:12.559 --> 32:13.519
why?

436
32:24.759 --> 32:25.559
Lanxiang.

437
32:27.920 --> 32:29.319
This master of yours

438
32:30.920 --> 32:32.279
isn't learned enough.

439
32:33.559 --> 32:35.200
He doesn't understand anything.

440
32:39.000 --> 32:40.759
Furong is drunk.

441
32:40.960 --> 32:44.200
Take her to your place for the night.

442
32:45.039 --> 32:47.200
She'll be fine

443
32:47.400 --> 32:48.799
once she sobers up tomorrow.

444
32:50.720 --> 32:51.519
All right.

445
33:00.400 --> 33:01.680
Sister.

446
33:09.079 --> 33:10.079
(Sister.)

447
33:28.040 --> 33:30.790
(Tonight, we sisters will sit by the fire and talk into the night.)

448
33:31.192 --> 33:32.720
(I promise you'll have your fill.)

449
33:33.640 --> 33:34.519
(It's a promise.)

450
33:34.920 --> 33:36.920
(We'll see each other tonight.)

451
33:37.519 --> 33:38.279
(We will.)

452
34:27.119 --> 34:28.079
Is she asleep?

453
34:29.559 --> 34:30.480
She's asleep.

454
34:34.440 --> 34:36.559
It's not even a festival or special occasion.

455
34:37.119 --> 34:38.639
How did she get so drunk?

456
34:40.440 --> 34:41.760
We got carried away

457
34:42.199 --> 34:43.599
and had a few extra drinks.

458
34:47.679 --> 34:48.320
Perfect timing.

459
34:50.599 --> 34:51.480
Try this on.

460
35:03.360 --> 35:04.159
It's beautiful.

461
35:05.159 --> 35:05.840
Do you like it?

462
35:08.519 --> 35:09.679
Let me fasten it for you.

463
35:35.639 --> 35:37.880
How could I possibly wear so many clothes?

464
35:38.040 --> 35:40.030
Mother, don't strain your eyes sewing so late.

465
35:40.320 --> 35:41.199
It's not worth it.

466
35:43.840 --> 35:44.960
Silly girl.

467
35:46.480 --> 35:48.159
This isn't just about the clothes.

468
35:49.559 --> 35:52.280
It's about how you'll be regarded in the Lin Residence.

469
35:52.776 --> 35:54.590
There are so many people in the Lin Residence,

470
35:54.670 --> 35:55.670
and gossip is everywhere.

471
35:55.680 --> 35:57.960
They flatter those above them and look down on those below,

472
35:57.970 --> 35:59.590
treating people according to their status.

473
36:00.360 --> 36:02.159
Second Young Madam came from a humble family,

474
36:02.639 --> 36:03.920
so her dowry was modest.

475
36:04.360 --> 36:06.159
Not only did Concubine Zhou look down on her,

476
36:06.239 --> 36:07.840
but eventually even the servants

477
36:08.000 --> 36:09.800
made trouble for her behind her back.

478
36:12.639 --> 36:13.840
Don't worry, Mother.

479
36:14.400 --> 36:15.760
If anyone mistreats me,

480
36:16.320 --> 36:17.760
I'll make sure they answer for it.

481
36:21.720 --> 36:23.110
I know you can handle yourself.

482
36:23.880 --> 36:26.559
But when all is said and done, this marriage

483
36:27.800 --> 36:29.440
is between families of unequal standing.

484
36:32.719 --> 36:34.880
Your father and I have put you at a disadvantage.

485
36:36.800 --> 36:38.920
I'm afraid that once you enter the Lin Residence,

486
36:40.079 --> 36:41.400
if you're ever mistreated,

487
36:41.800 --> 36:43.920
you won't have anyone to stand up for you.

488
36:48.840 --> 36:50.960
If the Lin family dares mistreat Lanxiang,

489
36:51.079 --> 36:52.719
I'll fight them with everything I've got.

490
36:53.480 --> 36:55.840
There you go again, always talking about risking your life.

491
36:56.119 --> 36:58.119
How many lives do you have to risk?

492
36:58.840 --> 37:01.000
You'll only end up making things harder for Lanxiang,

493
37:01.000 --> 37:02.840
forcing her to find a way to save you again.

494
37:39.119 --> 37:39.880
Father.

495
37:44.440 --> 37:45.199
Mother.

496
37:46.264 --> 37:48.552
I'm not in the same position as Second Young Madam.

497
37:49.639 --> 37:51.119
No one will dare mistreat me.

498
37:55.719 --> 37:57.800
Lanxiang is right.

499
38:01.320 --> 38:04.239
No one in the Lin family will dare mistreat her.

500
38:04.679 --> 38:05.559
Mister Lu.

501
38:06.519 --> 38:07.519
Mister Lu.

502
38:11.880 --> 38:13.000
In this world,

503
38:13.360 --> 38:15.840
everything that brings an advantage also has a drawback,

504
38:15.840 --> 38:18.119
and every drawback can also bring an advantage.

505
38:20.679 --> 38:22.599
That imperial decree may be a cage

506
38:22.719 --> 38:25.239
that binds Lanxiang to this life,

507
38:27.199 --> 38:29.360
but if Lanxiang knows how to use it,

508
38:29.719 --> 38:32.480
it can also be her armor and her sword,

509
38:32.800 --> 38:34.519
protecting her from harm.

510
38:41.000 --> 38:43.639
His Majesty chose me to marry into the Lin family.

511
38:44.776 --> 38:46.920
If anyone dares make things difficult for me,

512
38:48.239 --> 38:50.119
they'll be defying His Majesty.

513
38:52.880 --> 38:54.000
To put it more seriously,

514
38:55.080 --> 38:57.384
they'll be going against His Majesty's will

515
38:59.000 --> 39:00.199
and showing him disrespect.

516
39:01.599 --> 39:03.199
Is... is that really true?

517
39:07.920 --> 39:08.800
Wanquan,

518
39:10.960 --> 39:12.880
I have a favor to ask.

519
39:16.840 --> 39:19.039
I've spent half my life struggling,

520
39:19.639 --> 39:21.000
with no son or daughter of my own.

521
39:21.360 --> 39:23.840
Lanxiang is my only disciple.

522
39:26.480 --> 39:28.880
On the day Lanxiang gets married,

523
39:29.800 --> 39:32.079
may I sit beside you

524
39:32.880 --> 39:34.679
as her master

525
39:36.320 --> 39:38.519
and join you and Guihua

526
39:39.159 --> 39:41.039
in seeing her off?

527
39:42.079 --> 39:42.400
This...

528
39:42.760 --> 39:43.199
Sir...

529
39:43.559 --> 39:44.119
No,

530
39:44.519 --> 39:46.960
how could you call that a favor?

531
39:47.239 --> 39:49.719
You're helping us when we need it most.

532
39:50.119 --> 39:51.159
All this time,

533
39:51.360 --> 39:53.920
you've done so much for us.

534
39:54.440 --> 39:57.280
We don't even know how to repay you.

535
39:58.000 --> 39:59.360
Thank you, Mister Lu.

536
40:00.119 --> 40:01.280
Thank you, Sir.

537
40:04.880 --> 40:06.119
In this world,

538
40:08.039 --> 40:10.280
we must give before we can receive,

539
40:10.840 --> 40:12.920
and only by receiving can we give.

540
40:13.440 --> 40:14.480
Wanquan,

541
40:15.199 --> 40:17.159
who knows what I may gain in return?

542
40:29.800 --> 40:31.119
Everyone knows

543
40:31.560 --> 40:32.800
what kind of family we are,

544
40:33.840 --> 40:35.119
and the Lin family knows as well.

545
40:36.200 --> 40:39.320
Naturally, my dowry can't compare with that of an official's daughter,

546
40:39.976 --> 40:42.504
but there's no need to pretend we're wealthier than we are

547
40:42.510 --> 40:44.056
and make things difficult for ourselves.

548
40:45.079 --> 40:46.880
Even if our families aren't of equal standing,

549
40:46.936 --> 40:48.760
this marriage was bestowed by the Emperor,

550
40:49.000 --> 40:51.000
so no one can say I'm not a suitable match.

551
40:55.440 --> 40:56.239
Father.

552
40:57.599 --> 40:58.239
Mother.

553
40:59.880 --> 41:02.719
Stop blaming yourselves for not being more capable.

554
41:03.880 --> 41:05.639
As long as you're both well,

555
41:07.519 --> 41:09.440
that is the greatest support I could ever have.

556
41:10.400 --> 41:11.639
No matter when,

557
41:12.840 --> 41:14.440
I know you'll always be behind me.

558
41:15.719 --> 41:16.960
As long as

559
41:17.960 --> 41:19.599
I always have a home to return to,

560
41:21.119 --> 41:23.599
I'll feel secure.

561
41:27.719 --> 41:28.519
All right.

562
41:29.119 --> 41:31.920
We won't say such discouraging things anymore.

563
41:47.500 --> 41:48.980
(Glorify the Family Name)

564
41:48.980 --> 41:50.660
(Legacy and Glory)

565
41:54.039 --> 41:55.000
Bow.

566
42:03.320 --> 42:04.199
Rise.

567
42:12.860 --> 42:16.260
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

568
42:16.260 --> 42:19.700
♪Lightly traced cause and effect♪

569
42:20.540 --> 42:23.220
♪Half a lifetime of longing♪

570
42:23.220 --> 42:26.660
♪Returns to this moment♪

571
42:27.020 --> 42:30.460
♪Love and guilt intertwine♪

572
42:30.540 --> 42:33.559
♪If the image isn't real, what does it matter?♪

573
42:33.559 --> 42:34.880
We respectfully welcome the bride.

574
42:35.784 --> 42:37.480
May she bring harmony to the household.

575
42:38.559 --> 42:39.679
I shall gladly obey.

576
42:44.000 --> 42:45.159
The ceremony is complete.

577
42:46.159 --> 42:47.840
Lead the way with lanterns.

578
42:48.360 --> 42:50.599
Go forth to welcome the bride.

579
42:50.599 --> 42:53.420
♪I only wish that where the lights grow dim♪

580
42:53.740 --> 42:58.140
♪You and I will walk there together♪

581
42:58.140 --> 43:04.460
(Upholding the Virtue of Generations Past)

582
43:05.340 --> 43:07.500
=Against the Current= (Next Episode's Preview)

583
43:10.872 --> 43:13.896
Congratulations on placing first in the provincial examination, Scholar Han.

584
43:14.239 --> 43:16.360
I also studied at Qixia Academy,

585
43:16.920 --> 43:19.360
so I know well that only after ten years of diligent study

586
43:19.512 --> 43:21.590
could you earn a place on the honor roll today.

587
43:22.840 --> 43:24.480
This is one of life's great joys,

588
43:24.584 --> 43:26.030
and I shouldn't spoil the occasion.

589
43:26.679 --> 43:27.320
But

590
43:28.199 --> 43:29.280
a smooth bridal procession

591
43:29.639 --> 43:31.199
is said to promise a smooth marriage.

592
43:32.719 --> 43:35.519
So I ask you and your fellow scholars

593
43:36.840 --> 43:37.639
to please make way.

594
43:38.159 --> 43:39.360
I heard the bride was a maid.

595
43:54.360 --> 43:56.039
I thought Commander Lin would say,

596
43:57.592 --> 43:59.110
"The Emperor bestowed this marriage,

597
44:00.239 --> 44:01.440
so I order you to make way."

598
44:17.580 --> 44:21.700
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

599
44:24.540 --> 44:29.060
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

600
44:30.340 --> 44:34.260
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

601
44:34.940 --> 44:37.700
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

602
44:38.420 --> 44:40.740
♪Though all the world may fade♪

603
44:40.740 --> 44:43.820
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

604
44:45.340 --> 44:49.580
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

605
44:52.500 --> 44:56.660
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

606
44:58.460 --> 45:02.020
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

607
45:02.020 --> 45:05.580
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

608
45:06.380 --> 45:12.060
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

609
45:12.420 --> 45:16.740
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

610
45:17.100 --> 45:20.060
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

611
45:20.060 --> 45:23.820
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

612
45:23.820 --> 45:26.700
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

613
45:26.700 --> 45:30.780
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

614
45:30.780 --> 45:34.140
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

615
45:34.140 --> 45:37.900
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

616
45:37.900 --> 45:41.900
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

617
45:42.660 --> 45:46.820
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

618
45:46.820 --> 45:50.260
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

619
45:50.260 --> 45:53.900
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

620
45:53.900 --> 45:56.780
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

621
45:56.780 --> 46:00.860
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

622
46:00.860 --> 46:04.220
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

623
46:04.220 --> 46:07.860
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

624
46:07.860 --> 46:15.660
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪
